misunderstandings-explained-w0sedct47","summary":"There's a cloud of misconceptions floating around caching, leading many engineers astray. Some believe caching is a \u2018set-it-and-forget-it\u2019 deal, others think it\u2019s a magical solution to all performance issues. Caching is an art, a strategic approach to improve system performance.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ab6d57bb26773d7948606dafb62479f3?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":42,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-08-18T08:32:30.187Z"},{"id":"byCBf6E2O","title":"$SALARIES$ in Data Analytics around the Globe","url":"https://medium.com/geekculture/salaries-in-data-analytics-around-the-globe-c49cf0d8cac8?source=rss----9758482ba857---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/salaries-in-data-analytics-around-the-globe-bycbf6e2o","summary":"The United States offers the highest salaries for data analysts in the U.S. On average, a data analyst can expect to earn around $80,000 per year. Seasoned professionals can make over $110,000, with tech titans like Google and Facebook often offering even higher salaries, along with bonuses and stock options.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a0ac14785dbfb1eb26dcac5dba18716b?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-05-22T02:41:46.587Z"},{"id":"7OHvFH0Hm","title":"Design Apps That Get Feedback","url":"https://medium.com/geekculture/design-apps-that-get-feedback-ea6f88f61845?source=rss----9758482ba857---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/design-apps-that-get-feedback-7ohvfh0hm","summary":"The topmost item on our home screen is a banner with recent news. When we update the message content on CloudFront, our app shows a notification tag on the banner. Clicking the banner brings users to a screen where they can see the full message. At the bottom, it gives the user two buttons to click.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/df81473bdd2c218396a1dfc271fec711?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-05-19T17:47:22.521Z"},{"id":"BrtgKiYQz","title":"A Computer Science Student\u2019s Perspective on Teaching Programming","url":"https://medium.com/geekculture/a-computer-science-students-perspective-on-teaching-programming-175dc11c24d9?source=rss----9758482ba857---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/a-computer-science-student-s-perspective-on-teaching-programming-brtgkiyqz","summary":"A Computer Science Student\u2019s Perspective on Teaching Programming: How my instructors helped me learn to code on Unsplash. Mary Paskhaver: Learning to program is difficult, especially when someone is trying it for the first time. She says students should write code that they can use.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/ccd33a34138989f076bc96bf8d38ce2f?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-05-12T17:11:56.123Z"},{"id":"eQONkYq0C","title":"When Should You Stop Working On Your Personal Project?","url":"https://medium.com/geekculture/when-should-you-stop-working-on-your-personal-project-d58ec3edd5c2?source=rss----9758482ba857---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/when-should-you-stop-working-on-your-personal-project--eqonkyq0c","summary":"When Should You Stop Working On Your Personal Project? It could be now or never, says Mary Paskhaver. When you plan out your project, try to stick to it. If you\u2019re feeling overwhelmed or unmotivated, consider taking a break.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/93f4bf941fd9627a26080008236590e1","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-05-07T08:37:16.091Z"},{"id":"mcjwnrkPB","title":"Why Google\u2019s BARD will beat ChatGPT","url":"https://medium.com/geekculture/why-googles-bard-will-beat-chatgpt-47a51447fd71?source=rss----9758482ba857---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/why-google-s-bard-will-beat-chatg